{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0e Guide a young bird on his quest to find the Chalice of Highland \u2694\ufe0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Chalice of Highland, embark on an epic adventure inspired by Gameboy aesthetics. Explore the world and dive into six challenging dungeons to recover the Chalice of Highland. As a brave bird, you\u2019ll wield a sword to battle enemies and use your unique ability to fly, uncovering secrets along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    6 Unique Dungeons: Each dungeon presents its own mechanics and challenges, keeping the gameplay fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    7 Epic Bosses: Face off against formidable bosses guarding each piece of the Chalice of Highland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    7 Dream Sequences: Uncover the hero's backstory through dream sequences that reveal the mysterious past of the Highlands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Customizable Screen Colors: Choose from different screen color palettes to enhance your retro gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Classic or Widescreen: Play in the original Gameboy format or switch to a 16:9 widescreen view for a modern twist.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3281550?t=1744528503","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3281550?t=1744528503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281550/d9cea3cd53a8f92977fcd1481f1eaf2ffe2f24f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744528503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281550/d9cea3cd53a8f92977fcd1481f1eaf2ffe2f24f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744528503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Ach